WEBVTT

1
00:00:25.675 --> 00:00:30.465
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hello, we have a reservation. The name is Ben Fischer.

2
00:00:31.215 --> 00:00:35.287
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Yes, here we are. A table for two?

3
00:00:35.841 --> 00:00:37.422
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, that’s right.

4
00:00:37.861 --> 00:00:39.816
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> OK, come this way.

5
00:01:04.775 --> 00:01:06.062
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Are you ready to order?

6
00:01:06.551 --> 00:01:10.787
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, I’ll have the soup and the mushroom ravioli, please.

7
00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:18.264
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’d like the mozzarella salad and then the chicken, please.

8
00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:23.070
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> What would you like to drink?

9
00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:26.345
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Just water for me.

10
00:01:26.508 --> 00:01:28.919
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> A bottle of mineral water, please.

11
00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:30.890
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Still or sparkling?

12
00:01:32.748 --> 00:01:34.931
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Is sparkling OK?

13
00:01:35.159 --> 00:01:36.527
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes, sparkling.

14
00:01:37.586 --> 00:01:38.499
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Perfect.

15
00:01:38.792 --> 00:01:39.737
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thank you.

16
00:01:40.209 --> 00:01:41.073
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thank you.

17
00:01:55.474 --> 00:01:56.256
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Bon appetite!

18
00:01:56.256 --> 00:01:59.906
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> That is really good. Smells nice?

19
00:01:59.906 --> 00:02:00.329
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah…

20
00:02:00.337 --> 00:02:01.225
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah really nice.

21
00:02:09.151 --> 00:02:10.186
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> How was your food?

22
00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:12.401
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It was great, thanks.

23
00:02:12.825 --> 00:02:14.047
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Really delicious.

24
00:02:14.258 --> 00:02:15.659
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Would you like a dessert?

25
00:02:16.621 --> 00:02:20.821
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No, thank you. Could we have the bill, please?

26
00:02:20.848 --> 00:02:21.679
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Of course.

27
00:02:21.752 --> 00:02:22.339
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thank you.